questions.explanation:
$CH_{3}$COOH $\rightleftharpoons CH_{3} COO^{–} + H^{+}$,   $K_{1}$ = 1.5 $\times$ 10^{ - 5}

$\Rightarrow K_{1} = {{$\left[ {C{$H_3$}CO{O^ - }} \right] \left[ {{H^ + }} \right]$} \over {$\left[ {C{H_3}COOH} \right]$}}$ = 1.5 $\times$ 10^{ - 5}

HCN $\rightleftharpoons$ CN^{–} + H^{+},     K_{2} = 4.5 × 10^{–10}

K_{2} = ${{$\left[ {C{N^ - }} \right] \left[ {{H^ + }} \right]$} \over {$\left[ {HCN} \right]$}}$ = 4.5 × $10^{–10}$

CN^{ - } + $CH_{3}$COOH $\rightleftharpoons$  HCN + $CH_{3}$COO^{ - }

K = ${{$\left[ {HCN} \right] \left[ {C{H_3}CO{O^ - }} \right]$} \over {$\left[ {C{N^ - }} \right] \left[ {C{$H_3$}COOH} \right]$}} \Rightarrow$ K = ${{{K_1}} \over {{K_2}}} = {{1.5 \times {{10}^{ - 5}}} \over {4.5 \times {{10}^{ - 10}}}}$

= 3.33 × $10^{4} \simeq$ 3.0 × $10^{4}$
